join Sipho (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
Sipho: There's a capture system on this house. Broken, but it's there.
- There is?
	Hope: There is?
	Sipho: You'd have seen it if you'd looked up.
	Sipho: The run's split in two places and the drum's open. Open water grows things.
	Sipho: Half a day's work. I'd want to see how it was routed.
	- You're offering to fix it?
		Hope: You're offering to fix it?
		Sipho: I'm offering to look at it. If it's what I think it is, then yes.
		set {GameState.quest_sipho_gutter_repair} = "active"
		[signal arg="objective:Repair the gutter run, fit a lid to the drum, reposition the drum"]
	- Why does it matter to you?
		Hope: Why does it matter to you?
		Sipho: Because it's throwing away a few hundred litres a storm and I walk past it twice a day.
		Sipho: That's all. It's not complicated.
		set {GameState.quest_sipho_gutter_repair} = "active"
[signal arg="hearts:sipho:1"]
